mages run correctly on FIPS-enabled clusters using validated crypto modules (no non-validated crypto in the request path) — this epic delivers that for the Platform Operator.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":43646,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a9536c0861243fc4","agent_id":"ab2915676e1df60fa","session_id":"b1b2271b-4c69-47a7-906c-4aa2a3507a54","uuid":"71fbb079-b3ff-4267-bcb2-23693d87b090","timestamp":"2026-10-23T15:47:30.592Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9013"}
