d CI work).\n- The documentation scope excludes workbenches, pipelines, and training FIPS posture, matching the strategy's out-of-scope statement.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- **HLR-4 (P2)**: Documentation states the FIPS support posture and cluster prerequisites.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44764,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a9536c0861243fc4","agent_id":"ab2915676e1df60fa","session_id":"b1b2271b-4c69-47a7-906c-4aa2a3507a54","uuid":"9e9eb7b8-1dcf-462b-81de-508b0d1fc5c6","timestamp":"2026-10-23T15:47:46.718Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9013"}
