{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ba12af48390412ab","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9013\n3\tepic_count: 5\n4\tcritical_path_length: 3\n5\tdecompose_complete: true\n6\trevised: false\n7\ttriage: null\n8\ttriage_rationale: null\n9\t---\n10\t# Decomposition Summary — RHAISTRAT-9013 (FIPS 140-3 compliance for the model serving stack)\n11\t\n12\t## Epic List\n13\t\n14\t| ID | Title | Type | Team | Priority |\n15\t|----|-------|------|------|----------|\n16\t| RHAISTRAT-9013-E001 | FIPS remediation of KServe and serving data plane images | Implementation | RHOAI Serving | P0 |\n17\t| RHAISTRAT-9013-E002 | Platform Operator FIPS compliance | Implementation | RHOAI Serving | P0 |\n18\t| RHAISTRAT-9013-E003 | Compliance evidence package and certification submission | Implementation | RHOAI Serving | P0 |\n19\t| RHAISTRAT-9013-E004 | CI gating check for FIPS regressions | Implementation | RHOAI Serving | P1 |\n20\t| RHAISTRAT-9013-E005 | FIPS support posture documentation | Implementation (docs-authoring) | RHOAI Serving | P0 |\n21\t\n22\t## Dependency DAG\n23\t\n24\t```mermaid\n25\tgraph TD\n26\t    E001[RHAISTRAT-9013-E001 KServe image FIPS remediation] --> E003[RHAISTRAT-9013-E003 Evidence package and submission]\n27\t    E002[RHAISTRAT-9013-E002 Platform Operator FIPS compliance] --> E003\n28\t    E001 --> E004[RHAISTRAT-9013-E004 CI FIPS regression gate]\n29\t    E002 --> E004\n30\t    E001 --> E005[RHAISTRAT-9013-E005 FIPS documentation]\n31\t    E002 --> E005\n32\t    E003 --> E005\n33\t    E004 --> E005\n34\t```\n35\t\n36\t## DAG Justification\n37\t\n38\t| Edge | Rule | Rationale |\n39\t|------|------|-----------|\n40\t| E001 → E003 | Rule 13 (artifact consumption) | The evidence package consumes the module inventory, remediation records, and FIPS test results produced by the image remediation; it cannot be assembled before those artifacts exist. |\n41\t| E002 → E003 | Rule 13 (artifact