e check is gating in all serving-stack build pipelines, including the Platform Operator image builds: a build that reintroduces non-validated crypto usage in the request path fails.\n48\t- A verification test injects a known non-validated crypto linkage into a test build and observes the gate fail, confirming the check detects regressions end to end.\n49\t\n50\t## HLR Traceability\n51\t\n52\t- **HLR-3 (P1)**: CI enforces FIPS regressions: a gating check fails any serving-stack build that reintroduces non-validated crypto usage.\n53\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9c1fd37fcb0dc5ac","agent_id":"ab9d6186626e0d028","session_id":"b1b2271b-4c69-47a7-906c-4aa2a3507a54","uuid":"8d189480-ab7f-45db-a3ed-2ed5723fa2ac","timestamp":"2026-10-23T15:49:35.494Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9e9a246c1ae6fce9","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
