{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-829ddd0d7fb39f0c","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9013-E004\n3\ttitle: CI gating check for FIPS regressions\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9013\n5\tcomponent: KServe\n6\tteam: RHOAI Serving\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9013-E001\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-9013-E002\n12\tai_signals:\n13\t  change_specificity: 0\n14\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n15\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n16\t  existing_foundation: 1\n17\t  open_questions: 1\n18\t  external_dependency: 1\n19\t  human_process_gates: 1\n20\t  repo_access: 1\n21\t  architecture_claims: 1\n22\timplementation_type: null\n23\tinvestigation_signals: null\n24\tai_implementability: High\n25\tai_implementability_score: 7\n26\tjira_key: null\n27\tbranch: null\n28\tgated_by: null\n29\tgate_failure_impact: null\n30\t---\n31\t# CI gating check for FIPS regressions\n32\t\n33\t## Description\n34\t\n35\tThis epic adds a gating CI check that fails any serving-stack build which reintroduces non-validated cryptographic module usage, locking in the FIPS-remediated state of the model serving stack.\n36\t\n37\t## Scope\n38\t\n39\t- Implement a build-time check that scans built serving-stack images for non-validated cryptographic library linkage (including transitive dependencies), reusing the detection criteria established by the image remediation audit.\n40\t- Wire the check into the serving-stack build pipelines (Konflux), covering all serving-stack builds including the Platform Operator image builds.\n41\t- Configure the check as gating: a build fails when non-validated crypto is (re)introduced in the request path.\n42\t- Derive the pass/fail baseline from the remediated image set so that only regressions — not the pre-remediation state — fail builds.\n43\t\n44\t## Acceptance Criteria\n45\t\n46\t- A build-time check scans serving-stack images for non-validated cryptographic library linkage.\n47\t- The check is gating in all serving-stack build pipelines, including the Platform Operator image builds: a build that reintroduces non-validated crypto usage in the request path fails.\n48\t- A verification test injects a known non-validated crypto linkage into a test build and observes the gate fail, confirming the check detects regressions end to end.\n49\t\n50\t## HLR Traceability\n51\t\n52\t- **HLR-3 (P1)**: CI enforces FIPS regressions: a gating check fails any serving-stack build that reintroduces non-validated crypto usage.\n53\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ac13f1b5084b4195","agent_id":"ad4a5cc8c8142fa9f","session_id":"b1b2271b-4c69-47a7-906c-4aa2a3507a54","uuid":"af962a25-f10c-443f-976b-f69d40eb188d","timestamp":"2026-10-23T15:55:01.796Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-829ddd0d7fb39f0c","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9013"}
